# Issue #2903 (P20, greenfield flag day): a create's seed carries its update
# alone (the API rebuilds the sync it stands for from the create), and document
# creates send expectedManifestHash without the manifest the API derives. Every
# entry below is one of those removed request properties. Remove this whole
# file as soon as main contains the new contract.
